<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><b>4. ACQUISITIONS
(CONTINUED)</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">These transactions
were accounted for under the acquisition method of accounting in accordance with ASC 805, Business Combinations. The results of the Yuanxing&#8217;s
operations have been included in the Company&#8217;s consolidated financial statements since December 23, 2022. The revenue and net loss
of the Yuanxing from the acquisition date to December 31, 2022 was $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaRevenue_c20221212__20221231__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--YuanxingMember_zNWquF6x91Q8" title="Revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaRevenue" contextRef="From2022-12-122022-12-31_custom_YuanxingMember" id="Fact001053" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">537,252</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaNetIncomeLoss_iN_c20221212__20221231__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--YuanxingMember_zngtAnCw4Bo6" title="Net inxome (loss)"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaNetIncomeLoss" contextRef="From2022-12-122022-12-31_custom_YuanxingMember" id="Fact001055" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">169,034</ix:nonFraction></span> respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30_custom_YuanxingMember" escape="true" id="Fact001057" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfRecognizedIdentifiedAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89F_eus-gaap--ScheduleOfRecognizedIdentifiedAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedTableTextBlock_hus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--YuanxingMember_zUzkKpHAHQa9" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">The following
summarizes the identified assets acquired and liabilities assumed pursuant to the acquisition of Yuanxing as of December 23, 2022:</p>

