<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">As of June
30, 2024 and December 31, 2023, the Company has accounts receivable, net of $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--AccountsReceivableNetCurrent_iI_c20240630_zTmm0u7Ej75h" title="Accounts receivable"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2024-06-30" id="Fact001118" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,988,344</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--AccountsReceivableNetCurrent_iI_c20231231_z9OprWW7oYEh" title="Accounts receivable"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" id="Fact001120" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,874,494</ix:nonFraction></span>. The allowance for doubtful accounts
was $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent_iI_c20240630_zCHniUwOzmMk" title="Allowance for doubtful accounts"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2024-06-30" id="Fact001122" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">398,099</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent_iI_c20231231_ziNHY5V8uQtg" title="Allowance for doubtful accounts"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" id="Fact001124" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">407,480</ix:nonFraction></span> as of June 30, 2024 and December 31, 2023.</p>

