    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_F03_zBQapv7ZkA49" style="font-size: 10pt">(2)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F17_zCXK9AU8Rohg" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001262" xml:lang="en-US">On September 16, 2021, Meiwu
    Shenzhen entered into a loan agreement with Shenzhen Qianhai Weizhong Bank to borrow $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--LongTermDebtNoncurrent_iI_c20210916__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_z1COOEliXrag" title="Long-term bank loan" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtNoncurrent" contextRef="AsOf2021-09-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" id="Fact001264" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">414,072</ix:nonFraction></span> as working capital for two years, with
    maturity date of <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_c20210916__20210916__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zbz86jovOP93" title="Debt maturity date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-09-162021-09-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001266" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">September 16, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20210916__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zOqAn28ua8Bc" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2021-09-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" id="Fact001268" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8.46</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum. The loan is guaranteed by Mr. Changbin
    Xia, for whom the chief executive officer of Meiwu Shenzhen. The maturity date of this loan is extended to <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20240316__20240316__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember_zdKWm6UbKkG4" title="Debt maturity date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-03-162024-03-16_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ShenzhenQianhaiWeizhongBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001270" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">March 16, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></span></ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
