  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_F04_zLojjRPVCJyg" style="font-size: 10pt">(3)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F19_zPywovd4tLn8" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001271" xml:lang="en-US">On January 6, 2022, Meiwu
    Shenzhen entered into a loan agreement with China Construction Bank to borrow $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_z5L1aRfPnkig" title="Short-term bank loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact001273" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">217,045</ix:nonFraction></span> as working capital for one year, with maturity
    date of <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20220106__20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zs68AeVpJ5hg" title="Debt maturity date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-062022-01-06_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001275" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">January 6, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20220106__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zLBrpFC6jUp7" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-06_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact001277" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.0525</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum. And the maturity date of this loan is extended
    to April 16, 2023.On October 14, 2022, Meiwu Shenzhen entered into a loan agreement with China Construction Bank to borrow $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20221014__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_z6Y8kIoMRjVk" title="Short-term bank loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2022-10-14_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact001279" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">71,768</ix:nonFraction></span>
    as working capital for one year, with maturity date of <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20221014__20221014__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zxPhis3fdFIa" title="Debt maturity date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-10-142022-10-14_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001281" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">October 14, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The loan bears a fixed interest rate of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20221014__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankMember_zN58TyGAv0z6" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJBTksgTE9BTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-10-14_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankMember" id="Fact001283" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.90</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum.
    </ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
  </table>
</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AC_z5DhKNEAJMz2" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">Due to
(1), (2) and (3) breach of the covenant, the banks are contractually entitled to request for immediate repayment of the outstanding loans
amount of $408,685. The outstanding balance are presented as a current liabilities as of June 30, 2024.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">As of the
date when these consolidated financial statements were approved by the management, management is in the process of renegotiating the
terms of the loans arrangement with the banks and expects that a revised loan agreement will be in place after the financial year end.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact001285" name="us-gaap:AccountsPayableAndAccruedLiabilitiesDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_808_eus-gaap--AccountsPayableAndAccruedLiabilitiesDisclosureTextBlock_zlX4WlBWNMai" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><b>10.
