    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F11_zAaB9EV6fvI7" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001512" xml:lang="en-US">During IPO, the underwriters
    purchased <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction_c20240101__20240630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--EternalHorizonInternationalCompanyLimitedMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--IPOMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--UnderwritersMember_zcmI8kd47ILc" title="Sale of stock" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIERVRSBUTyBSRUxBVEVEIFBBUlRJRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30_custom_EternalHorizonInternationalCompanyLimitedMember_us-gaap_IPOMember_custom_UnderwritersMember" id="Fact001514" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">999,910</ix:nonFraction></span> ordinary shares from a selling shareholder for $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction_c20240101__20240630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--EternalHorizonInternationalCompanyLimitedMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--IPOMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--UnderwritersMember_zgT8LM5zYGIh" title="Sale of stock value" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIERVRSBUTyBSRUxBVEVEIFBBUlRJRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30_custom_EternalHorizonInternationalCompanyLimitedMember_us-gaap_IPOMember_custom_UnderwritersMember" id="Fact001516" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">4,999,550</ix:nonFraction></span>. The gross proceeds were wired into the Company&#8217;s
    account and was invested in loan receivable together with net proceeds from IPO. The Company paid $<span id="xdx_903_ecustom--PaymentToUnderwriters_pn5n6_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--EternalHorizonInternationalCompanyLimitedMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--IPOMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--UnderwritersMember_zbxYxHXY4uwe" title="Payment to underwiters" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIERVRSBUTyBSRUxBVEVEIFBBUlRJRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="WNW:PaymentToUnderwriters" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EternalHorizonInternationalCompanyLimitedMember_us-gaap_IPOMember_custom_UnderwritersMember" id="Fact001518" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.6</ix:nonFraction></span> million to the underwriters
    for the year ended December 31, 2022.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 24px; padding-bottom: 6pt; text-align: right"><span style="font-size: 10pt"><sup id="xdx_F00_zAbvnDrhcLai">(2)</sup></span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F19_zGtIKGA3yJ15" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001519" xml:lang="en-US">The Company borrowed loans
    as working capital from one shareholder Changbin Xia as well as the legal representative of Vande. The balance due to related parties
    is interest-free and due on demand.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
  </table>
</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A5_z9cyb746Nxd7" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>


